  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to our beautiful beach home which offers everything needed for a wonderful beach vacation! This magnificent home includes 2 spacious living rooms, 5 master bedrooms with full bathrooms, frameless shower doors and custom tile to the ceiling. There are also custom twin XL built-in bunks to sleep 4 kids or adults! Don't worry about climbing the stairs to load groceries or luggage as the spacious house has a built-in elevator accessible on all floors for convenience. After a full day at the beach, you can enjoy relaxing at our in ground pool which can be heated, especially during cool evenings. You can walk to the beach or choose to drive the 6-seater vibrant red street legal golf cart for convenience! There are plenty of Tommy Bahama beach chairs (10+), beach umbrellas (3+), and lots of beach toys to enjoy the sunshine. Our home is equipped with state-of-the-art modern kitchen stainless steel large appliances (6 burner Viking Range) and a fully stocked kitchen to prepare meals for the whole family. We also have a separate laundry room, plenty of patio/balcony spaces, and can comfortably accommodate up to 16 guests. We are located in the heart of Gulf Place on 30A and less than a 2-minute walk to the beach. Welcome to our beach paradise!<br><br>Owner is a Premier Host on Vrbo and a Superhost on Airbnb with highly rated 5-Star Reviews. Please check out our other property reviews!<br><br>ABOUT THE AREA:<br>Our beach home is located in the heart of Gulf Place with a short walk to beach access, restaurants, ice cream/candy shops and craft beer options.<br><br>BEACH ACCESS:<br>Gulfplace Paradise is steps from Ed Walline Public Beach Access. A short walk or take the 6-passenger golf cart to 3 nearby beach access.<br><br>ACCOMODATIONS:<br>Bedroom 1 - King with ensuite bathroom (1st Floor)<br>Bedroom 2 - King with ensuite bathroom (2nd Floor)<br>Bedroom 3 - King with ensuite bathroom (3rd Floor)<br>Bedroom 4 - King with ensuite bathroom (3rd Floor)<br>Bedroom 5 - King with ensuite bathroom (3rd Floor)<br>Bedroom 6 - 4 Twin XL bunk beds sleeps 4 with ensuite bathroom (3rd Floor)<br>Living Room 1 - Queen Sofa Sleeper (1st Floor)<br>Living Room 2 - 2 Large extra wide sofas<br><br>PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:<br>Private Pool with Heat Option<br>6-Seater Street Legal Golf Cart<br>3 Beach Umbrellas, 10 Beach Chairs, 14 Beach Towels and Beach Toys<br>Interior Elevator on all floors<br>Built in Artisan Grill <br>Large Laundry Washer & Dryer (3rd floor)<br>75\" Smart TV in Main Living Room <br>55 \" Smart TVs throughout<br>Coffee Maker - Traditional and Keurig Pods <br>Starter Kit - Toilet Paper, Paper Towels, Dishwasher Soap and Washing Machine Pods, Shampoo/Conditioner/Body Soap<br>Fully Stocked Kitchen<br>Linens provided<br>4 Parking Spaces <br>2 Baby/Toddler Play Pen<br>1 Baby High Chair<br>Bedroom closets have luggage holder<br>Extra Microwave and Mini Refrigerator on 1st floor Living Room<br>Outdoor Shower (side of house-near pool area)<br><br><br>IMPORTANT NOTES:<br>* Additional fee applies to heat the pool and bring pet dog(s); guest to discuss fee with Owner. No cats allowed.<br>* Guest must designate number of guests during booking process. Any changes to be communicated prior to arrival.<br>* No smoking/vaping inside the property.<br>* The property has a security camera covering the front driveway for safety purposes.<br>* Check-in details, including the keypad door code, will be provided one day prior to your arrival.<br><br>IMPORTANT PRIOR TO ARRIVAL:<br>* Guest required to sign an electronic rental agreement.<br>* Guest required to provide a photo ID (i.e. driver's license) for verification of identity and proof of insurance coverage for using the gold cart.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
